1
00:00:00,616 --> 00:00:02,416
(Howard:)Are you saying
you want to get married?

2
00:00:02,419 --> 00:00:05,049
(Penny:)Vegas isn't
that far away.

3
00:00:06,022 --> 00:00:07,492
(Leonard:)I'm in. Let's do it.

4
00:00:07,491 --> 00:00:09,091
(squeals quietly)

5
00:00:14,797 --> 00:00:16,937
(Sheldon:)After all these years.

6
00:00:18,034 --> 00:00:19,864
(Sheldon:)I'm really happy
for the two of you.

7
00:00:19,870 --> 00:00:21,040
(Penny:)Oh, thank you.
Thanks.

8
00:00:21,038 --> 00:00:23,138
(Sheldon:)Now get out of my spot.

9
00:00:26,542 --> 00:00:29,312
(Howard:)Bernie, Stuart just pulled up.

10
00:00:30,113 --> 00:00:31,443
(Howard:)So remember,

11
00:00:31,448 --> 00:00:33,178
(Howard:)the key is to be firm.

12
00:00:33,183 --> 00:00:34,383
(Howard:)Show no weakness.

13
00:00:34,384 --> 00:00:36,884
(Sheldon:)Right.
Good luck.

14
00:00:36,887 --> 00:00:39,257
(Bernadette:)Howard Joel Wolowitz,
you get back here.

15
00:00:40,590 --> 00:00:43,360
(mutters) Never should have
told you my middle name.

16
00:00:43,360 --> 00:00:46,700
(Stuart:)Hey, guys.
Hey, you got
a minute?

17
00:00:46,697 --> 00:00:49,697
(Stuart:)Sure. Uh, let me just put
this stuff in the fridge.

18
00:00:49,700 --> 00:00:51,970
(Stuart:)I felt bad for finishing
your yogurt, so I bought more.

19
00:00:51,969 --> 00:00:54,169
And, Howard, your favorite
fruit is in season.

20
00:00:54,171 --> 00:00:57,021
(Stuart:)Crunch Berries.

